feature requests, and pull requests are welcome! See the [Contributing Guide](CONTRIBUTING.md) for development setup, testing, and plugin development instructions. For questions and discussions, join us on [Discord](https://discord.com/invite/FG6hMJStWu).\n\n## 📄 License\n\n[MIT](LICENSE)\n"
